#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:5
#: 99fe127a7a764ac1929524261bae565d
msgid "Simple and Super Simple Modes"
msgstr "Simple和Super Simple模式"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:7
#: d2ad0704def6457bb6e583b90b68de1f
msgid ""
"This article describes the behaviour of the *Simple* and *Super Simple* "
"modes and explains how you can set up selection of these modes from your RC "
"Transmitter."
msgstr "本文介绍*Simple*和*Super Simple*模式的行为，并说明如何从RC遥控器上设置这些模式的选择方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:12
#: 79732f289d0d49a5a51be0720b837699
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:14
#: b0d9ff8cae2f4835a503c6f99be7ae32
msgid ""
"\"Simple\" and \"Super Simple\" modes allow the pilot to control the "
"movement of the copter from the pilot's point of view regardless of which "
"way the copter is facing. This is useful for new pilots who have not "
"mastered adjusting their roll and pitch inputs depending upon which way the "
"vehicle is facing and for cases when the copter is far enough away that it's"
" heading is not apparent."
msgstr ""
"\"Simple\"和\"Super "
"Simple\"模式允许飞手从飞手的视角控制飞行器的移动，而不管飞行器朝哪个方向。这对于尚未掌握根据飞行器朝向调整横滚和俯仰输入的新手飞手，以及飞行器距离较远导致无法判断其航向的情况非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:21
#: 148e3f8488794096a2b0adbefd0db78f
msgid ""
"\"Simple\" and \"Super Simple\" modes can be used in combination with nearly"
" all flight modes except the Acro and Drift (in these flight modes the "
"setting is ignored)."
msgstr "\"Simple\"和\"Super Simple\"模式几乎可以与所有飞行模式组合使用，除了Acro和Drift（在这些飞行模式下该设置被忽略）。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:24
#: 394741c30c5c452f9cb5f69d8ce77d03
msgid ""
"Simple Mode allows you to control the copter relative to the copters heading"
" at take off and relies only on a good compass heading."
msgstr "Simple模式允许您相对于起飞时飞行器的航向来控制飞行器，仅依赖良好的罗盘航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:26
#: 82d0b559786e43129ef0a1d1800d640c
msgid ""
"Super Simple Mode allows you to control the copter relative to it's "
"direction from home (i.e. where it was armed) but requires a good GPS "
"position."
msgstr "Super Simple模式允许您相对于飞行器距Home的方向（即解锁地点）来控制飞行器，但需要良好的GPS位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:29
#: e60ab1da29cd4cdc90f5a1dad2c02a23
msgid ""
"Either mode can be assigned to a particular flight mode switch position or "
"can be enabled/disabled from the :ref:`Ch7/Ch8 switches "
"<channel-7-and-8-options>`."
msgstr ""
"两种模式均可分配给特定飞行模式开关档位，或通过 :ref:`Ch7/Ch8开关 <channel-7-and-8-options>` 启用/禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:36
#: 4f8592d980e04ace97617dfba05262a1
msgid "Normal Mode"
msgstr "普通模式"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:41
#: 20400730196941e1b956bada0e920ff8
msgid ""
"Without Simple or Super Simple enabled, the pilot's transmitter stick inputs"
" are applied in the orientation of the copter.  For example in the diagram "
"above when the pilot applies roll input right (red) the vehicle rolls to "
"it's right."
msgstr ""
"未启用Simple或Super Simple时，飞手的遥控器摇杆输入以飞行器的朝向为基准。例如，在上图中，当飞手向右输入横滚时，飞行器向其自身右方横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:46
#: 0b8d238e68034a3098b258acdbacc853
msgid ""
"With the copter is facing in the same direction as the pilot, it is "
"relatively easy to control the vehicle but when the vehicle is facing "
"towards the pilot an inexperienced pilot will feel that the controls are all"
" reversed.  I.e. if the pilot inputs right roll, the vehicle will move to "
"the left from the pilot's point of view."
msgstr ""
"当飞行器与飞手朝向相同时，控制飞行器相对容易，但当飞行器朝向飞手时，没有经验的飞手会感觉操控完全相反。即，若飞手输入右横滚，从飞手角度看飞行器会向左移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:55
#: 6c89f831893045aba11d60c613e12281
msgid "Simple Mode"
msgstr "Simple模式"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:60
#: 7d6dcf3f30254171b49a3c4e607bfad3
msgid ""
"Similar to the \"care free\" mode on other systems, this mode allows you to "
"fly your copter as though it were pointed in the direction it was pointed "
"when it was armed regardless of its current heading orientation.  So if you "
"hold the pitch stick forward the copter will fly away from you, pull the "
"pitch stick back and it will come back towards home.  You can even apply yaw"
" to spin the copter in any direction but the movement of the copter's "
"position relative to the stick inputs will behave exactly as it did at take "
"off."
msgstr ""
"类似于其他系统的\"无忧\"模式，此模式允许您像飞行器始终指向解锁时的方向一样飞行，无论其当前航向如何。因此，前推俯仰摇杆，飞行器将飞离您；拉回俯仰摇杆，飞行器将飞回Home方向。您甚至可以施加偏航使飞行器在任何方向旋转，但飞行器位置相对于摇杆输入的移动行为将与起飞时完全相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:69
#: 36f383b431134fe8a46cabdb89c3b429
msgid ""
"Generally when arming you should stand behind the vehicle with it's nose "
"pointing directly away from you.  While flying you should try to keep the "
"vehicle flying in front of it's starting position because if it flies behind"
" you all the controls will feel reversed."
msgstr ""
"通常解锁时，您应站在飞行器后方，机头直接朝远离您的方向。飞行时应尽量使飞行器在起始位置前方飞行，因为如果飞行器飞到您身后，所有控制感觉都会相反。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:74
#: da154de2a1c24fb08937b87373a40626
msgid ""
"As mentioned above simple mode is also very useful in emergency situations "
"where the copter is far enough away that it is very difficult to determine "
"it's heading."
msgstr "如上所述，Simple模式在紧急情况下也非常有用，当飞行器距离足够远以至于很难判断其航向时。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:81
#: 3ffac00a4ce4481fb75fa34d4dfc5ad6
msgid "Super Simple Mode"
msgstr "Super Simple模式"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:86
#: ab7be27fc5a54e77a271e7c75a0a89ee
msgid ""
"Super Simple mode is the same as simple mode except that it uses the "
"vehicle's position relative to home instead of the vehicle's initial heading"
" when it was armed. This means that no matter where the vehicle is, pulling "
"the pitch back will cause it to return towards home regardless of the "
"vehicle's actual heading."
msgstr ""
"Super "
"Simple模式与Simple模式相同，只是它使用飞行器相对于Home的位置，而非解锁时的初始航向。这意味着无论飞行器在何处，拉回俯仰摇杆都会使飞行器返回Home方向，而不管飞行器实际航向如何。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:92
#: 63a203117de74048a3e9b490110b73dd
msgid ""
"The advantage over simple mode is that the controls are applied from the "
"pilot's point of view even when the copter flies behind the pilot/home "
"location."
msgstr "相比Simple模式的优势在于，即使飞行器飞到飞手/Home位置后方，控制仍以飞手的视角为基准施加。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:96
#: 9380036c8a8b486ba0ffd4592dcd7d64
msgid ""
"If the pilot holds full right roll the vehicle will fly a circle clockwise "
"around the pilot (although the circle's radius may tend to grow slightly "
"with each orbit due to \"lag\")."
msgstr "如果飞手保持满右横滚，飞行器将以顺时针方向绕飞手转圈飞行（尽管由于\"滞后\"，每圈的半径可能会略有增大）。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:100
#: 5d60137508e64943b1b61abe8b831bd8
msgid ""
"The disadvantage is that mode require a GPS lock because so you should "
"ensure you have GPS lock before take-off."
msgstr "其缺点是该模式需要GPS锁定，因此应确保起飞前已获得GPS锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:103
#: fb9f58c5d6774e4d93e673e5e8422c64
msgid ""
"The orientation is not updated when the vehicle is within 10m of home "
"meaning close fly-bys of the home location should be avoided."
msgstr "在距Home 10米以内时，方向不会更新，因此应避免在Home位置附近近距离飞过。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:106
#: f0b0764f6685498f8b4ebd1a1f6de214
msgid ""
"To ensure the controls are correct right at take-off, as with simple mode, "
"you should arm with the pilot standing behind the vehicle and with both "
"pilot and vehicle pointing in the same direction."
msgstr "为确保起飞时控制正确，与Simple模式一样，解锁时飞手应站在飞行器后方，且飞手和飞行器朝向相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:111
#: a0dfb0531ee34a9195f1a07bb4db18f9
msgid "Selecting the modes from a transmitter"
msgstr "从遥控器选择模式"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:113
#: 9b29c39f7aeb4388a2bbf2ea3d555e64
msgid ""
"The transmitter’s :ref:`auxiliary channels <channel-7-and-8-options>` can be"
" set-up to enable selection of Simple mode, Super Simple mode or both. Only "
"one auxiliary channel should be set for these modes, and this channel will "
"override the simple/super-simple options selected on the Flight Modes "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"遥控器的 :ref:`辅助通道 <channel-7-and-8-options>` 可设置为选择Simple模式、Super "
"Simple模式或两者均可。只应将一个辅助通道设置为这些模式，且该通道将覆盖飞行模式界面上选择的Simple/Super Simple选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:122
#: 1133bd0915564bf1ab00054e42513fb2
msgid "Mission Planner: Channel 7 options for Simple andSuperSimple modes"
msgstr "Mission Planner：Simple和SuperSimple模式的通道7选项"

#: ../../source/docs/simpleandsuper-simple-modes.rst:124
#: bf52c967d5a04b60bf0bdf5ba3a5aa10
msgid ""
"To support selection of just one of the modes from the transmitter, assign "
"the mode to a channel that is mapped to a 2-position switch (high = enables "
"the selected mode, low disables it). To enable both modes from the same "
"switch, select *Super Simple mode* for a channel that is mapped to a "
"3-position switch (high position = Super Simple mode, middle position = "
"Simple mode, low position = disabled)."
msgstr ""
"若要从遥控器仅选择其中一种模式，请将该模式分配给映射到两档开关的通道（高=启用所选模式，低=禁用）。若要从同一拨杆同时支持两种模式，请为映射到三档拨杆的通道选择*Super"
" Simple模式*（高位=Super Simple模式，中位=Simple模式，低位=禁用）。"
